A manga adaptation illustrated by Yutaka Ohhori began serialization in Square Enix's seinen manga magazine Monthly Big Gangan on September 25, 2018. The manga's chapters have been collected into twelve tankōbon volumes as of March 2025. The manga is published digitally in North America by Comikey and by Square Enix via their Manga UP! Global app.
