Anime
An anime television series adaptation was announced on January 21, 2024. The series is produced by J.C.Staff and directed by Toshinori Fukushima, with Touko Machida handling series composition and episode screenplays, Mina Ōsawa designing the characters, and Misaki Umase composing the music. It is set to premiere in October 2025, on Tokyo MX and other channels.
